 85    /** FUNCTION otap_objects.otap_session_set_test_set
 86    * Sets the current active test set. If test set name is longer than 256 chars
 87    * it is cutted to 256 chars. If NULL is given than, otap_constants.OTAP_DEFAULT_TEST_SET
 88    * is used.
